{"challenges":[{"attack":"Check whether the quoted dispatch wording entails the real-world shipment fact, rather than only what the record states.","claim_id":"shipped-cartons","outcome":"survives","result":"The claim is explicitly about the dispatch record's statement, and the citation exactly matches it.","tool_ids":[]},{"attack":"Check whether the quoted packing wording entails the claimed source assertion.","claim_id":"carton-capacity","outcome":"survives","result":"The claim is explicitly about the packing specification's statement, and the citation exactly matches it.","tool_ids":[]},{"attack":"Check whether two source attributions establish that 96 units were actually shipped.","claim_id":"originally-shipped","outcome":"fails","result":"The sources establish only record contents. No assumption or source establishes that the dispatch and packing records are accurate descriptions of the actual shipment.","tool_ids":[]},{"attack":"Check whether the quoted receiving wording entails the claimed source assertion.","claim_id":"recorded-damage","outcome":"survives","result":"The claim is explicitly about the receiving record's statement, and the citation exactly matches it.","tool_ids":[]},{"attack":"Check whether the condition is presented as discharged proof rather than an explicit limitation.","claim_id":"damage-completeness-condition","outcome":"survives","result":"It is expressly labeled an additional assumption and is not claimed to be established by the records.","tool_ids":[]},{"attack":"Check whether 96 minus 3 establishes an actual usable-unit count without assuming the shipment records are accurate.","claim_id":"usable-units","outcome":"fails","result":"The stated condition addresses identity and completeness of damage, but not the truth of the dispatch count or packing specification; its supporting step inherits the unsupported actual 96-unit premise.","tool_ids":[]}],"checks":[{"basis_reasoning":"The exact cited source substring is present and the claim is limited to what the dispatch record states.","basis_verdict":"source_attributed","checked_step_ids":[],"claim_id":"shipped-cartons","reasoning":"Supported as source attribution, not as proof that 12 cartons actually shipped.","verdict":"supported"},{"basis_reasoning":"The exact cited source substring is present and the claim is limited to what the packing specification states.","basis_verdict":"source_attributed","checked_step_ids":[],"claim_id":"carton-capacity","reasoning":"Supported as source attribution, not as proof that every actual carton contained eight units.","verdict":"supported"},{"basis_reasoning":"Step-shipped-units correctly computes 12 × 8 = 96, but its stated premises are only source assertions. The claim asserts an actual shipment quantity.","basis_verdict":"unsupported","checked_step_ids":["step-shipped-units"],"claim_id":"originally-shipped","reasoning":"The arithmetic is valid for the records' combined reported quantity, but no evidence establishes record accuracy; the unqualified real-world conclusion is unsupported.","verdict":"unsupported"},{"basis_reasoning":"The exact cited source substring is present and the claim is limited to what the receiving record states.","basis_verdict":"source_attributed","checked_step_ids":[],"claim_id":"recorded-damage","reasoning":"Supported as source attribution, not as proof that exactly three actual units were damaged.","verdict":"supported"},{"basis_reasoning":"This is expressly an added assumption, is needed for the subtraction, and is not discharged by a source or proof step.","basis_verdict":"conditional","checked_step_ids":[],"claim_id":"damage-completeness-condition","reasoning":"Appropriately conditional, but it does not expressly assume the dispatch and packing records are accurate.","verdict":"conditional"},{"basis_reasoning":"Step-usable-units has correct arithmetic conditional on an actual 96-unit shipment and exactly three unusable units. Its dependency originally-shipped is unsupported as worded.","basis_verdict":"unsupported","checked_step_ids":["step-shipped-units","step-usable-units"],"claim_id":"usable-units","reasoning":"The claim should additionally condition on the dispatch and packing records accurately describing this shipment, or be restated as a records-based calculation.","verdict":"unsupported"}],"missing_evidence":["Evidence that the dispatch record and packing specification accurately describe the actual shipment.","Evidence that the receiving record accurately identifies three actual damaged units from that shipment, beyond the stated conditional assumption."],"recommended_action":"revise","tool_requests":[]}
